{
  "Name": "Honeywell Tema Remote Installer ActiveX Remote Code Execution",
  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability found in the Honeywell Tema ActiveX Remote Installer. This ActiveX control can be abused by using the DownloadFromURL() function to install an arbitrary MSI from a remote location without checking source authenticity or user notification. This module has been tested successfully with the Remote Installer ActiveX installed with Honeywell EBI R410.1 - TEMA 5.3.0 and Internet Explorer 6, 7 and 8 on Windows XP SP3.",
